    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, it states that a declaration (linguistic object) has a literary constraint as its subject. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS indica che una dichiarazione (oggetto linguistico) ha come argomento una costrizione letteraria. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object e come range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"
      }
    ],
